ChangeLog for the UTS Global 3270-support patch

Sep 2002:	Get bootup colors right on 3270 console
	* In tubttybld.c, substantially revise ESC processing so that
/* bench 28416.1.0 ffec299553c7 */
/* bench 28416.1.1 bc513b42b400 */
/* bench 28416.1.2 d422c555ba9b */
/* bench 28416.1.3 be2082384237 */
/* bench 28416.1.4 a2cd37edf12e */
/* bench 28416.1.5 aa0a0fe929cd */
